      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5433,
      "text": "when He has created you in stages[4]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5434,
      "text": "Do you not see how Allah has created seven heavens, one above another,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5435,
      "text": "and has placed the moon therein as a light and the sun as a burning lamp?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5436,
      "text": "Allah has produced you from the earth like a plant[5],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5437,
      "text": "then He will return you into it and then will bring you out again.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 504,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5438,
      "text": "Allah has made the earth widespread for you",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
