      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5440,
      "text": "Noah said, “My Lord, they have disobeyed me and followed those whose wealth and children did not increase them except in loss[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5441,
      "text": "They have contrived a mighty plot,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5442,
      "text": "They said, ‘Do not abandon your gods; and do not abandon Wadd, Suwā‘, Yaghūth, Ya‘ūq, and Nasr[8].’",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5443,
      "text": "They have led many astray. So [O Lord], do not increase the wrongdoers except in error.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5444,
      "text": "Because of their sins, they were drowned and then were cast into the Fire, and they did not find any helpers against Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5445,
      "text": "Noah said, “My Lord, do not leave on earth a single disbeliever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5446,
      "text": "For if You leave them, they will surely lead Your slaves astray and beget none but wicked disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 571,
      "ruku": 505,
      "hizbQuarter": 228,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5447,
      "text": "My Lord, forgive me and my parents, and whoever enters my house as a believer, and all the believing men and women, and do not increase the wrongdoers except in ruin.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 71,
        "name": "سُورَةُ نُوحٍ",
        "englishName": "Nooh",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Noah",
